{"id":"n86382-1-10","stage":3,"title":"형태 · 形态","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n86382-1-10-1","ko":"요즘에는 어떤 전화기가 잘 팔리나요?","zh":"最近哪种手机卖得比较好？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘에는","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘에는","audio":"/audio/89b296d651a66ff651ca.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"전화기가","meaning":"电话机","explanation":"전화기：电话机；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"전화기","audio":"/audio/920d2edb729250383ea3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70846","senseId":"1","lemma":"전화기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전화기가","audio":"/audio/6fbfc7f16bfac895f5a3.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，有效地","explanation":"잘：很好地，有效地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"13","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"팔리나요?","meaning":"被卖掉，被卖出","explanation":"팔리다：被卖掉，被卖出；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"팔리다","audio":"/audio/5f104909fa8ff0fa0801.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71483","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"팔리나요","audio":"/audio/42401c4cc697374d52e9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"哪一个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问在现有的多个人或事物中，作为对象的是什么。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"920d2edb72925038","term":"전화기","zh":"电话机","audio":"/audio/920d2edb729250383ea3.mp3","entryId":"70846","definition":"把说话声变成电波或电流发送出去，使相隔很远的人也可以互相对话的机器。","pronunciation":["전ː화기"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，有效地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"功能或效果让人满意地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"5f104909fa8ff0fa","term":"팔리다","zh":"被卖掉，被卖出","audio":"/audio/5f104909fa8ff0fa0801.mp3","entryId":"71483","definition":"收取钱财后，物品或权利被交给对方或劳动力等被提供。","pronunciation":["팔리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/873e597dd2ce50bb4017.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n86382-1-10-2","ko":"화면이 크고 자판이 없는 형태의 전화기가 유행이에요.","zh":"屏幕大且没有键盘类型的手机很流行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"화면이","meaning":"画面","explanation":"화면：画面；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"화면","audio":"/audio/b5361f64b2ea31de8f50.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91689","senseId":"2","lemma":"화면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화면이","audio":"/audio/e770296b2d2551fb252d.mp3"}},{"text":"크고","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔","explanation":"크다：大，高，长，壮阔；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"크고","audio":"/audio/9b4dd3b3d5bdf723a01b.mp3"}},{"text":"자판이","meaning":"键盘","explanation":"자판：键盘；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"자판","audio":"/audio/756a518da243a13ab863.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24802","senseId":"1","lemma":"자판","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자판이","audio":"/audio/3338d36dd50a738b68ec.mp3"}},{"text":"없는","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","